@startuml
title Routing and optimization metamodel
left to right direction
hide methods
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Optimization <<source>> {
  mode: satisfy | weighted | lexicographic | pareto
  type: MONO | MULTI | MANY [0..1]
}
class Term <<source>> {
  direction: minimize | maximize [0..1]
  weight: positive number [0..1]
  normalize: bounds [0..1]
}
class PenaltyTerm <<source>> {
  weight: positive number [0..1]
}
class RoutingOverlay <<source>> {
  uniform: true [0..1]
}
class RoutingEntry <<source>> {
  probability: 0..1
}
class ResourceRef <<core>> {
  resource: string
  id: string
}
class ExclusiveBranch <<source>>

Optimization "1" *-- "0..*" Term
Optimization "1" *-- "0..*" PenaltyTerm
Term "1" *-- "1" ResourceRef : metric
PenaltyTerm "1" *-- "1" ResourceRef : constraint or transition

RoutingOverlay "1" *-- "0..*" RoutingEntry
RoutingEntry "1" *-- "1" ResourceRef : branch or sequenceFlow
RoutingEntry ..> ExclusiveBranch : target

note bottom of RoutingOverlay
  Exactly one authoring form: uniform or entries.
  A routed XOR has every probability or none; supplied values sum to 1.
end note
@enduml
